                "text": "On World AIDS Day, we mourn the lives lost in the fight against HIV and AIDS.\n\nThe U.S. has long led the fight to expand access to prevention, treatment, and care and end the stigma of AIDS. \n\nInstead, the Trump White House has dramatically cut federal funding, threatening to disrupt hard-earned progress and raising fears of a resurgence of this formerly fatal disease.\nhttps://t.co/yXAvOrbOpV",
